62,"Title":"Karen with Arm in Cast, West Oakland, CA","Artist":"Joanne Leonard","Date":"c. 1965","Medium":"Gelatin silver print","CreditLine":"Gift of the artist in honor of Julia Marjorie Leonard and in memory of P. Alfred and Marjorie R. Leonard","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/397762","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjQ2ODIzMCJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=dd9c9518d6dda650"},{"ObjectID":409690,"Title":"Scribbles and a Square with Not Straight Horizontal and Straight Vertical Lines Outside and Straight Horizontal and Not Straight Vertical Lines Inside (plate 47) from Squarings","Artist":"Sol LeWitt","Date":"2003","Medium":"One from an illustrated book with forty-eight letterpress illustrations","CreditLine":"Gift of Dian Woodner","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/409690","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjQ4NDk4NyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=c6b79b8d68b98f72"},{"ObjectID":419630,"Title":"Sketchbook #56, New York City","Artist":"Ellsworth Kelly","Date":"1965","Medium":"Spiral-bound sketchbook with cut-and-pasted colored paper and pencil on paper","CreditLine":"Gift of Jack Shear","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/419630","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjU0Mzk4OCJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=b979517bbef7ed08"},{"ObjectID":427582,"Title":"Guardián del Maizal","Artist":"Antonio Paucar","Date":"2013","Medium":"High-definition video (color, sound)","CreditLine":"Latin American and Caribbean Fund","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/427582","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjUwNzkxMyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=d7c8c9d76be122ba"},{"ObjectID":434540,"Title":"La fin du monde filmée par l’ange N.-D. (The End of the World, as Filmed by the Angel of Notre-Dame)","Artist":"Fernand Léger","Date":"Published 1919 (additional materials c. 1918–19); rebound 1950","Medium":"Book with twenty-two pochoirs (designs by Léger), six with line-block reproductions of drawings; text in letterpress, line block, and pochoir; publisher’s original paper cover. Rebound with additional preparatory materials: maquette of the entire book printed in line block and letterpress (without pochoir) and four additional proofs of individual illustrations, one with corrections in ink and gouache. Bespoke rebinding, slipcase, and chemise by Bonet. Rebinding: covers of full dark-blue goat leather over boards with multicolor calf-leather onlays and inlays, blind and gold tooling, and gold-tooled title on spine; red-and-green suede-and-leather doublures and flyleaves; dark-blue silk endbands; gilt edges","CreditLine":"Gift of Helen and Sam Zell","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/434540","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjY0NTU2NiJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=be7a73fdd836b1a3","OnView":1},{"ObjectID":487222,"Title":"Index of Plates from Litany of Water (Litanie d'eau)","Artist":"Gregory Masurovsky","Date":"1964","Medium":"One from an illustrated book with ten etchings (plus index of plates)","CreditLine":"Gift of John S. Newberry (by exchange)","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/487222","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjU4ODYwOCJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=dc8280b83d30a987"},{"ObjectID":505114,"Title":"Rooms #0","Artist":"Rafaël Rozendaal","Date":"2026","Medium":"Onchain non-fungible token (JavaScript generative code on Ethereum)","CreditLine":"Gift of Neil Hutchinson and Fellowship Gallery","URL":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/505114","ImageURL":"https://www.moma.org/media/W1siZiIsIjYxNzg3MyJdLFsicCIsImNvbnZlcnQiLCItcmVzaXplIDEwMjR4MTAyNFx1MDAzZSJdXQ.jpg?sha=15307c642d6030c3"}]